# Prometheus — canonical source

The truth for Prometheus URL/config lives in the IaC repo. Do not derive from
Grafana, SSH into a box, or ask the user. Record the exact repo path below.

- Canonical source: `<repo>/<path>/values.yaml` (edit this line to point to your actual repo)
- Derived views: Grafana dashboards, CloudWatch, deployed pod env vars — do not treat these as source of truth.
